# Code of Conduct

This project adopts the [Contributor Covenant](https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/code_of_conduct/), version 2.1.

## Reporting

Report Code of Conduct violations privately to ${author_email}.

## Scope

This applies in all project spaces — issue trackers, pull requests, mailing lists, chat rooms, and public events when representing the project.
